 takeaways=["An operator maps whole functions to whole functions.", "Neural operators are trained on pairs from a classical solver, then solve new inputs instantly.", "DeepONet uses branch and trunk networks; Fourier neural operators learn in frequency space.", "Training inputs must cover the inputs you will meet later."],
